        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 3910S, Century Sliding Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Century Privacy Pocket Door Mortise Lock is made out of solid brass and is available in a wide array of finishes. Choose from finishes like the ever popular satin nickel or oil rubbed bronze. This sliding pocket door lock provides privacy for use on bedrooms and bathrooms. It is good for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with at least 1/8 inch clearance. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe finger edge pull is screwed into the door's edge so that you have something to grip in order to slide the door out of the pocket. The flush pulls are screwed into the door's face. The mortise lock body is easily mounted with two screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/century-passage-pocket-door-set-omnia-3910s-p\"><b>Century Passage Pocket Door Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/century-solid-brass-round-flush-pull-omnia-7503-52\"><b>Century Round Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 3910S Century Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Trim Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Length: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Depth: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set:</b> privacy mortise lock body, two (2) round flush pulls, edge pull, strike plate, and all mounting hardware. For One (1) Door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
