                "description": "The Century Privacy Pocket Door Mortise Lock is made out of solid brass and is available in a wide array of finishes. Choose from finishes like the ever popular satin nickel or oil rubbed bronze. This sliding pocket door lock provides privacy for use on bedrooms and bathrooms. It is good for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with at least 1/8 inch clearance. \r\n",
